<shoppingcart id="shoppingcart" userinfo="{{userinfo}}"></shoppingcart>


<van-popup show="{{ show }}" round position="bottom" bind:close="onClose" z-index="998" closeable safe-area-inset-bottom="{{false}}">
  <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;margin: 30rpx;padding-bottom: 30rpx;border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;">
    <!-- <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;margin-right: 30rpx;" bind:tap="allcheck">
      <radio color="#005832" checked="{{allcheck}}" />
      <view style="font-size: 32rpx;color: #005832;margin-left: 10rpx;">全选</view>
    </view> -->
    <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;" bind:tap="delcartgoods">
      <image src="/images/lajitong.png" style="width: 30rpx;height: 30rpx;" />
      <view style="font-size: 32rpx;color: rgb(102, 92, 92);margin-left: 10rpx;">清空所有</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <scroll-view style="width: 100%;height: 900rpx;" bindscrolltolower="scrolltolower" scroll-y>
    <view style="width: 690rpx;margin: 30rpx;border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;padding-bottom: 30rpx;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;margin-top: 0;" wx:for="{{cartlist}}" wx:key="id" bind:tap="checkcart" data-index="{{index}}">
      <radio checked="{{index == cartindex}}" color="#005832" />
      <image src="{{item.goods_img}}" style="width: 180rpx;height: 180rpx;border-radius: 20rpx;margin-left: 30rpx;" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view style="margin-left: 30rpx;width: {{boxwidth}}rpx;">
        <view style="width: 100%;font-size: 32rpx;font-weight: bold;overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;white-space: nowrap;">{{item.goods_name}}</view>
        <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;margin: 10rpx auto;">
          <view class="hbox" style="height: 120rpx;height: 40rpx;font-size: 24rpx;line-height: 40rpx;">
            <text wx:if="{{item.zttype==12}}">配送/自提</text>
            <text wx:if="{{item.zttype==1}}">仅自提</text>
            <text wx:if="{{item.zttype==2}}">仅配送</text>
          </view>
          <view class="hbox" style="height: 120rpx;height: 40rpx;font-size: 24rpx;line-height: 40rpx;">{{item.xg_num==0?'不限购':'限购 '+item.xg_num}}</view>
        </view>
        <view style="width: 100%;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;">
          <view style="font-size: 36rpx;font-weight: bold;color: #005832;">￥{{userinfo.level==1?item.memberprice:item.normalprice}}</view>
          <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;">
            <block wx:if="{{item.number>0}}">
              <view class="chanumbox" bind:tap="reducenum" data-type="cart" data-index="{{index}}">-</view>
              <input type="num" style="width: 50rpx;text-align: center;font-size: 30rpx;" value="{{item.number}}" bindblur="innum" data-type="cart" data-index="{{index}}" />
            </block>
            <view class="chanumbox" bind:tap="addnum" data-type="cart" data-index="{{index}}">+</view>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view style="height: 180rpx;"></view>
</van-popup>
<van-popup show="{{zitiquerenshow}}" round z-index="1000" bind:click-overlay="guanbi">
  <view class="ztbody flex1" style="{{ztdian ? 'height:720rpx;':''}}">
    <view class="flex1">
      <view class="xian"></view>
      <view class="ztH1">{{ztdian ? '确认' : '选择'}}自提点</view>
      <view class="xian"></view>
    </view>
    <view style="font-size: 36rpx;color: #000;font-weight: bold;margin: 30rpx 0 20rpx;">{{ztdian ? '请确认是否在此自提点' : '已为您推荐距离最近自提点'}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{ztdian}}" style="font-size: 36rpx;color: #000;font-weight: bold;margin: 0 0 40rpx;">提货</view>
    <image style="width: 120rpx;height: 120rpx;border-radius: 60rpx;background-color: #993300;flex-shrink: 0;" src="{{ztdian2.zt_headimg}}"></image>
    <view class="flex2" style="font-size: 24rpx;color: #666;margin: 20rpx 0 30rpx;"><view style="max-width: 300rpx;" class="txt1">{{ztdian2.zt_name}}</view> | 距您{{ztdian2.distance}}km</view>
    <view class="ztbut1 flex1" bind:tap="choztdian123"><text>选择其他自提点</text></view>
    <view class="ztbut2 flex1" bind:tap="yesztdian"><text>确认并提交订单</text></view>
  </view>
</van-popup>
<van-popup show="{{commodityshow}}" bind:close="commodityclo" closeable="true" position="bottom" style="z-index: 999;" safe-area-inset-bottom="{{false}}" custom-style="background-color:#eee;">
  <view style="padding: 30rpx 30rpx 0;">
    <view style="font-size: 30rpx;font-weight: bold;">
      订购详情
    </view>
    <view style="width: 690rpx;height: 100rpx;border-radius: 20rpx;background-color: white;display: flex;margin-top: 30rpx;">
      <view style="z-index: 1;width: 50%;line-height: 100rpx;text-align: center;font-size: 30rpx;{{chooseStyle==2?'color:white;font-weight: bold;':''}}" bind:tap="chooseStyle" data-id="2" wx:if="{{zttype!=1}}">送货上门</view>
      <view style="z-index: 1;width: 50%;line-height: 100rpx;text-align: center;font-size: 30rpx;color: #999999;" bind:tap="nottap" data-type="2" wx:else>送货上门</view>
      <view style="z-index: 1;width: 50%;line-height: 100rpx;text-align: center;font-size: 30rpx;{{chooseStyle==1?'color:white;font-weight: bold;':''}}" bind:tap="chooseStyle" data-id="1" wx:if="{{zttype!=2}}">线下自提</view>
      <view style="z-index: 1;width: 50%;line-height: 100rpx;text-align: center;font-size: 30rpx;color: #999999;" bind:tap="nottap" data-type="1" wx:else>线下自提</view>
      <view style="width: 334rpx;height: 94rpx;margin: 5rpx;position: absolute;background-color: #015637;border-radius: 20rpx;z-index: 0;transform: translate({{xdistance}}rpx);transition:transform 0.5s"></view>
    </view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y="true" style="width: 100%;height: 60vh;margin-top: 30rpx;">
      <view style="width: 690rpx;background-color: white;margin: 0 0 30rpx;border-radius: 20rpx;padding-top: 30rpx;" wx:if="{{chooseStyle==2}}">
        <view style="padding-bottom: 30rpx;border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;width: 630rpx;margin: 0 auto;" bind:tap="take">
          <view style="width: 630rpx;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;">
            <view style="font-size: 30rpx;">收货地址</view>
            <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;">
              <view wx:if="{{shouAddress}}" style="font-size: 30rpx;color: #015637;margin-right: 10rpx;">{{shouAddress.username}} {{shouAddress.phone}}</view>
              <image src="/images/blackjiantou.png" mode="" class="yjt"></image>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #999;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis;width: 630rpx;margin-top: 30rpx;" wx:if="{{shouAddress}}">{{shouAddress.street}}{{shouAddress.address}}</view>
          <view style="width: 630rpx;margin: 30rpx 0;font-size: 28rpx;color: #999;" wx:else>请选择您的收货地址</view>
        </view>
        <view>
          <view style="width: 630rpx;display: flex;align-items: center;padding: 30rpx;justify-content: space-between;height: 30rpx;">
            <view style="font-size: 30rpx;">送货时间</view>
            <!-- <picker mode="selector" range="{{timelist}}" bindchange="pickerchange" value="{{indexlist}}">
            <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;">
              <view wx:if="{{song_time}}" style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #003300;">{{song_time}}</view>
              <view wx:else style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #999;">请选择送货时间</view>
              <image src="/images/blackjiantou.png" mode="" class="yjt" style="margin-left: 10rpx;"></image>
            </view>
          </picker> -->
            <view class="flex2" bind:tap="changTime">
              <view wx:if="{{zindextime != -1}}" style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #003300;">{{timelist[zindexday].day}}- {{timelist[zindexday].items[zindextime].sendstar}}~{{timelist[zindexday].items[zindextime].sendend}}</view>
              <view wx:else style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #999;">请选择送货时间</view>
              <image src="/images/blackjiantou.png" mode="" class="yjt" style="margin-left: 10rpx;"></image>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view style="font-size: 26rpx;color: #f60;padding: 0 30rpx 30rpx;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;">{{send_tip}}</view>
      </view>
      <view style="width: 690rpx;background-color: white;margin: 0 0 30rpx;border-radius: 20rpx;padding-top: 30rpx;" wx:else>
        <!-- <picker mode="selector" range="{{ztdianlist}}" range-key="zt_name" bindchange="changeziti"> -->
        <view style="padding-bottom: 30rpx;border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;width: 630rpx;margin: 0 auto;" bind:tap="choztdian">
          <view style="width: 630rpx;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;">
            <view style="font-size: 30rpx;">自提门店</view>
            <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;">
              <view wx:if="{{ztdian}}" style="font-size: 30rpx;color: #015637;margin-right: 10rpx;">{{ztdian.zt_name}}</view>
              <view wx:else style="font-size: 30rpx;color: #015637;margin-right: 10rpx;">请选择自提门店地址</view>
              <image src="/images/blackjiantou.png" mode="" class="yjt"></image>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #999;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis;width: 630rpx;margin-top: 30rpx;" wx:if="{{ztdian}}">{{ztdian.zt_addressxinagxi}}</view>
          <view style="width: 630rpx;margin-top: 30rpx;font-size: 28rpx;color: #999;" wx:else>您还没有选择自提地址</view>
        </view>
        <!-- </picker> -->
        <view style="width: 630rpx;display: flex;align-items: center;padding: 30rpx;justify-content: space-between;height: 30rpx;">
          <view style="font-size: 30rpx;">提货电话</view>
          <input type="number" placeholder="请填写提货人手机号码" placeholder-style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #999;" value="{{userphone}}" bindinput="inuphone" style="font-size: 28rpx;color: #003300;text-align: right;" maxlength="11" />
        </view>
        <view style="font-size: 26rpx;color: #f60;padding: 0 30rpx 30rpx;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;">{{send_tip}}</view>
      </view>
      <view style="width: 690rpx;background-color: white;margin: 30rpx 0;border-radius: 20rpx;padding-top: 30rpx;">
        <view style="display: flex;width: 630rpx;margin: 0 auto;">
          <image src="{{Detail.goods_img}}" mode="aspectFill" class="tx"></image>
          <view>
            <view style="overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;white-space: nowrap;width: 440rpx;">{{Detail.goods_name}}</view>
            <view class="fbt" style="overflow: hidden;text-overflow: ellipsis;white-space: nowrap;width: 440rpx;">
              {{Detail.small_title}}
            </view>
            <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;width: 440rpx;">
              <view class="money">￥ {{userinfo.level==1?Detail.memberprice:Detail.normalprice}}</view>
              <van-stepper value="{{num}}" bind:change="onChange"></van-stepper>
            </view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view style="width: 630rpx;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;margin: 30rpx;border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;padding-bottom: 30rpx;">
          <view style="font-size: 30rpx;">商品小计</view>
          <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;">
            <text style="font-size:28rpx;color:#030;margin-right: 10rpx;">￥{{zongmoney}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view style="width: 630rpx;display: flex;align-items: center;justify-content: space-between;margin: 30rpx;border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;padding-bottom: 30rpx;">
          <view style="font-size: 30rpx;color: red;">使用卡券</view>
          <view style="display: flex;align-items: center;" bind:tap="choosecard">
            <text style="font-size:28rpx;color:red;margin-right: 10rpx;" wx:if="{{coupons&&coupons.length>0}}">-￥{{coupon_money}} x {{coupons.length}}</text>
            <text style="font-size:28rpx;color:{{have_quan >0 ? 'red':'red'}};margin-right: 10rpx;" wx:else>{{have_quan >0?'您有'+have_quan+'张可用优惠券':'没有可使用的优惠券'}}</text>
            <image src="/images/blackjiantou.png" mode="" class="yjt"></image>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="underline flex3">
